     --exit-severity={note,warning,error,failure} 
                    Exit after an assertion failure of 
                    this severity
     --format={fst,vcd} 
                    Waveform dump format
     --include=GLOB Include signals matching GLOB in 
                    waveform dump
     --shuffle      Run processes in random order
     --stats        Print time and memory usage at end of 
                    run
     --stop-delta=N Stop after N delta cycles (default 
                    10000)
     --stop-time=T  Stop after simulation time T (e.g. 5ns)
     --trace        Trace simulation events
 -w, --wave[=FILE]  Write waveform dump to FILE

Coverage report options:
 -o, --output=dir   Output directory for HTML report
     --exclude-file=FILE 
                    Apply exclude file when generating 
                    report, see manual for syntax
     --dont-print={covered,uncovered,excluded} 
                    Exclude specified items from coverage 
                    report
     --item-limit=LIMIT 
                    Display at most LIMIT items in a 
                    single report file (default 5000)
     --per-file     Create source file code coverage 
                    report.

Coverage merge options:
     --merge-mode={union,intersect} 
                    Merge hierarchies by union or 
                    intersection, default is union
 -o, --output=FILE  Output database file name

Coverage export options:
     --format=FMT   File format (must be 'cobertura')
 -o, --output=FILE  Output file name
     --relative=PATH 
                    Report file names relative to PATH

Install options:
     --dest=DIR     Compile libraries into directory DIR

Library search paths:
  /root/.nvc/lib
